{
  "uid": "cmtc-authenticated-only",
  "title": "CMTC | Workload Security",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 4,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": [
    "cmtc",
    "experimental",
    "ztunnel",
    "mtls"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-10m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Native authenticated-only trial — no application-port list",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Native panels: isolated cmtc-mtls fixture only.** The Cluster selector affects planned CMTC panels below. **Planned panels: not implemented; No data is expected until their stories land.**\n\n**Two nodes · no application sidecars · no CNP / CCNP / KNP.** Native authentication checks reject an absent verified TLS principal, without an application-port list.\n\n**Locally tested paths:** mTLS on 80 / 8080 / 9443 and Service 18080 → 8080; unenrolled and host clients receive no HTTP response. Independent request and restart-probe results belong to the recorded run; the panels show the selected time range.\n\n**Open gates:** effective workload authorization, creation/restore capture, platform exceptions, cross-cluster and transport composition. **Complete Protected status is not claimed.**"
      },
      "description": "Experimental scope, demonstrated paths and explicit remaining security gates."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "mTLS TCP connections started",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#59a14f"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 48
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cmtc-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(increase(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\",reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"mtls-spike\",connection_security_policy=\"mutual_tls\"}[${__range_ms}ms] @ end())) or on() (0 * sum(increase(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\",reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"mtls-spike\"}[${__range_ms}ms] @ end())))) and on() (sum(up{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\"} @ end()) == 2)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Destination-reported TCP opens after peer TLS authentication, with connection_security_policy=mutual_tls. Counter increase over the selected time range, handling resets and extrapolated by Prometheus. Not HTTP requests, successful application responses, or TLS handshakes; authenticated connections can still be denied by authorization policy."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "TCP attempts without verified mTLS",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#f28e2b"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 48
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cmtc-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(increase(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\",reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"mtls-spike\",connection_security_policy!=\"mutual_tls\"}[${__range_ms}ms] @ end())) or on() (0 * sum(increase(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\",reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"mtls-spike\"}[${__range_ms}ms] @ end())))) and on() (sum(up{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\"} @ end()) == 2)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Destination-reported TCP opens without a verified mTLS peer. Incremented before authorization, including attempts later rejected. Counter increase over the selected time range, handling resets and extrapolated by Prometheus. Does not establish accepted plaintext or count HTTP requests."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Connections rejected by policy — DENY",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#f28e2b"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 48
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cmtc-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(increase(istio_tcp_connections_failed_total{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\",reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"mtls-spike\",response_flags=\"DENY\"}[${__range_ms}ms] @ end())) or on() (0 * sum(increase(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\",reporter=\"destination\",destination_workload_namespace=\"mtls-spike\"}[${__range_ms}ms] @ end())))) and on() (sum(up{job=\"cmtc-spire-ztunnel\",cluster=\"cmtc-mtls\"} @ end()) == 2)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Actual destination-reported native failed TCP counter with response_flags=DENY, regardless of authentication state. These rejections overlap the attempted connection counters; never add this stat to TCP attempts to form a total. Counter increase over the selected time range, handling resets and extrapolated by Prometheus."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "ztunnel metrics targets UP · expected 2",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
