      "description": "Last scrape UP count at the selected range end; expected 2. This measures metrics reachability, not verified workload protection. Missing data is unavailable."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "mTLS application bytes sent/s · source",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
